2. After that: migrations

    Once the schema is settled, create something like:

        db/
        ├── migrations/
        │   ├── 001_create_users.sql
        │   ├── 002_create_venues.sql
        │   ├── 003_create_events.sql
        │   ├── 004_create_availability.sql
        │   └── 005_create_bookings.sql
        └── seed.sql

    The important part is that your database should be reproducible:

        empty PostgreSQL database
            ↓
        run migrations
            ↓
        same schema every time
            ↓
        run seed
            ↓
        usable development database


